<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on Roche.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on Roche.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, 2 October 1996 - Bankers Trust International has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Roche dividend right certificates, lead manager Bankers Trust AG said.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one certificate.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    9400.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	8.90 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     38.85 SFR		 GEARING	12.0 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 17.OCT.96-17.OCT.97   PAYDATE	16.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  9345.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
